msgstr "在首页以地图显示你的播放列表：大小取决于歌曲数，按文件夹相连，点击即可打开。"

#. Translators: {name} is the name of a theme made in the colour editor.
#: src/app.rs:2507
#, rust-format
msgid "Saved theme “{name}”"
msgstr "已保存主题“{name}”"

#: src/app.rs:2513
msgid "Couldn't save the theme."
msgstr "无法保存主题。"

#. Translators: A setting: on the Settings page, the top bar's search box searches the settings.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1185
msgid "Search settings from the top bar"
msgstr "从顶栏搜索设置"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1323
msgid "On this page, the search box at the top searches the settings instead of Spotify."
msgstr "在此页面上，顶部的搜索框会搜索设置，而不是 Spotify。"

#. Translators: Home map layout: a round tree, each level of folders a ring further out.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:963
msgid "Tree"
msgstr "树状"

#. Translators: Home map layout: each folder a circle around what it holds.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:971
msgid "Circles"
msgstr "圆圈"

#. Translators: Home map: what to do with the rest of the Library while a folder is open.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:980
msgid "Open folder:"
msgstr "打开的文件夹："

#. Translators: Home map: keep the rest further out and zoom in on the open folder, or on what the Library's filters list.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:985
msgid "Zoom in"
msgstr "放大"

#. Translators: Home map: show only what the open folder holds.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:995
msgid "Only its contents"
msgstr "仅其内容"

#. Translators: Home map: what to do with what the Library's filters (Playlists, Albums, By You, search) leave out.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:1007
msgid "Filters:"
msgstr "筛选："

#. Translators: Home map: show only what the Library's filters list.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:1020
msgid "Only what they list"
msgstr "仅筛选结果"

#. Translators: A setting: with Spotifast's own title bar, show the app's version in the top bar.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1195
msgid "Show version"
msgstr "显示版本"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1339
msgid "With the custom title bar, show Spotifast's version and this fork's beside the update button."
msgstr "使用自定义标题栏时，在更新按钮旁显示 Spotifast 及此分支的版本。"

#. Translators: A settings section about what Spotify suggests: mixes, recommendations, related artists.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2375
msgid "Suggestions"
msgstr "推荐内容"

#. Translators: A setting: show only what you look for, click or open, none of Spotify's suggestions.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2377
msgid "Only what I ask for"
msgstr "只显示我要的"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2382
msgid "Hide what Spotify suggests: Made for you, top mixes, new releases, Recommended for you, Fans also like, and Autoplay."
msgstr "隐藏 Spotify 推荐的内容：为你打造、热门合辑、新发行、为你推荐、粉丝也喜欢和自动播放。"

#. Translators: Library sidebar button: show the Library as the playlist map in place of its rows.
#: src/ui/sidebar.rs:2028
msgid "Show as map"
msgstr "以地图显示"

#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:1138
msgid "Scroll to zoom, drag the background to pan, double-click for everything. Click to open, right-click for more, drag playlists, folders or songs to where they go."
msgstr "滚动缩放，拖动背景平移，双击查看全部。单击打开，右键查看更多，把歌单、文件夹或歌曲拖到要去的地方。"

#. Translators: Home map toggle: make each playlist, album or folder as large as the time listened to it.
#: src/demo.rs:7173
msgid "Size by listening"
msgstr "按收听时长缩放"

#. Translators: How long the songs played from a playlist, album, artist, podcast or folder were listened to. {time} is a length of time, such as 2 hr 13 min.
#: src/ui/playlist_map.rs:1532
#, rust-format
msgid "{time} listened"
msgstr "已收听 {time}"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2446
msgid "Keep every play"
msgstr "保留每次播放"

#. Translators: {folder} is the path of the folder older plays are kept in.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2450
#, rust-format
msgid "Off, the newest 500 plays are kept. On, older plays move to {folder} instead of being deleted, each with how long you listened and where it was played from."
msgstr "关闭时保留最近 500 次播放。开启后，较早的播放会移到 {folder} 而不是被删除，每次都记录收听时长和播放来源。"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:94
msgid "Clear play history?"
msgstr "清除播放记录？"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:96
msgid "Every play Spotifast has kept will be deleted, along with the listening time the map is sized by. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Spotifast 保留的所有播放都将被删除，地图用于缩放的收听时长也会一并删除。此操作无法撤销。"

#. Translators: Library sidebar button: choose to show the Library as rows, cover cards or the playlist map.
#: src/demo.rs:2997
msgid "Show as"
msgstr "显示方式"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2421
msgid "Vacuum"
msgstr "Vacuum"

#. Translators: Vacuum's main switch.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2423
msgid "Listen in a vacuum"
msgstr "在真空中聆听"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2424
msgid "Hide artist descriptions"
msgstr "隐藏艺人简介"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2425
msgid "Hide playlist descriptions"
msgstr "隐藏歌单简介"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2426
msgid "Show titles of Spotify's theme playlists"
msgstr "显示 Spotify 主题歌单的名称"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2427
msgid "Replace my own name and picture"
msgstr "替换我自己的名字和头像"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2428
msgid "Replace my own playlists"
msgstr "替换我自己的歌单"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2429
msgid "Hide pages about a person or popularity"
msgstr "隐藏关于某人或热度的页面"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2430
msgid "Pictures"
msgstr "图片"

#: src/session_reads.rs:3005
msgid "Seed"
msgstr "种子"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2437
msgid "Every song, album, artist, playlist and person gets a stand-in name and picture, the same everywhere, and what centres on people and popularity is hidden. Alt+Shift+D switches it."
msgstr "每首歌、专辑、艺人、歌单和人物都换成到处一致的替代名称和图片，以人物和热度为中心的内容会被隐藏。Alt+Shift+D 切换。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2444
msgid "Artist biographies show ???. Off, they show with the names Vacuum knows swapped."
msgstr "艺人简介显示为 ???。关闭后显示，但 Vacuum 认识的名字会被替换。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2451
msgid "Playlist and podcast descriptions show ???. Off, they show with the names Vacuum knows swapped."
msgstr "歌单和播客简介显示为 ???。关闭后显示，但 Vacuum 认识的名字会被替换。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2458
msgid "Spotify's own playlists about a mood, genre or activity keep their real titles."
msgstr "Spotify 自己关于心情、流派或活动的歌单保留真实名称。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2463
msgid "Off, your own name and picture stay as they are."
msgstr "关闭时，你自己的名字和头像保持原样。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2469
msgid "Off, your own playlists keep their titles, descriptions and the covers you gave them."
msgstr "关闭时，你自己的歌单保留名称、简介和你设置的封面。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2476
msgid "Playlists about one artist or a chart, your top songs and radio stations show a notice, with Show anyway."
msgstr "关于单个艺人或排行榜的歌单、你的热门歌曲和电台会显示提示，并有“仍然显示”。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2483
msgid "Public-domain artworks from The Met, the Art Institute of Chicago and the Cleveland Museum of Art, shapes drawn offline, or a list of picture addresses of your own."
msgstr "来自大都会艺术博物馆、芝加哥艺术博物馆和克利夫兰艺术博物馆的公有领域作品、离线绘制的图形，或你自己的图片地址列表。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2490
msgid "Stand-ins come from a seed. Everyone shares one by default, so the same name has the same stand-in for everyone, here and in the Unfamiliar Sounds extension."
msgstr "替代名称由种子生成。默认所有人共用一个，所以同一个名字在这里和 Unfamiliar Sounds 扩展中对所有人都是同一个替代名称。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2527
msgid "Museums"
msgstr "博物馆"

#. Translators: Vacuum's pictures: shapes and rings drawn from each name.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2529
msgid "Shapes"
msgstr "图形"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2530
msgid "My list"
msgstr "我的列表"

#. Translators: {count} is how many picture addresses the list of your own holds.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2545
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} pictures"
msgstr "{count} 张图片"

#. Translators: {count} is how many picture addresses a list held.
#: src/app.rs:2590
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} pictures loaded"
msgstr "已载入 {count} 张图片"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2554
msgid "Load a list…"
msgstr "载入列表…"

#: src/app.rs:2596
msgid "Could not read that list of pictures"
msgstr "无法读取该图片列表"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2573
msgid "Using the shared seed"
msgstr "正在使用共享种子"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2587
msgid "Using your own seed"
msgstr "正在使用你自己的种子"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2594
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2596
msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2616
msgid "Save…"
msgstr "保存…"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2627
msgid "Use the shared seed"
msgstr "使用共享种子"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2646
msgid "A seed of your own, 8 to 500 characters"
msgstr "你自己的种子，8 到 500 个字符"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2660
msgid "Use this seed"
msgstr "使用此种子"

#: src/app.rs:2598
msgid "Seed saved"
msgstr "种子已保存"

#: src/app.rs:2601
msgid "Could not save the seed"
msgstr "无法保存种子"

#: src/app.rs:12258
msgid "Vacuum is on"
msgstr "Vacuum 已开启"

#: src/app.rs:12260
msgid "Vacuum is off"
msgstr "Vacuum 已关闭"

#: src/ui/topbar.rs:600
msgid "Vacuum is on (Alt+Shift+D)"
msgstr "Vacuum 已开启 (Alt+Shift+D)"

#: src/ui/topbar.rs:602
msgid "Vacuum is off (Alt+Shift+D)"
msgstr "Vacuum 已关闭 (Alt+Shift+D)"

#: src/ui/keys.rs:263
msgid "Vacuum on or off"
msgstr "Vacuum 开或关"

#: src/ui/friends.rs:99
msgid "Hidden by Vacuum"
msgstr "已被 Vacuum 隐藏"

#: src/ui/friends.rs:102
msgid "What your friends play stays out of sight while Vacuum is on."
msgstr "Vacuum 开启时，好友正在听的内容不会显示。"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:382
msgid "This page is about a person, or about what is popular."
msgstr "此页面关于某个人，或关于热门内容。"

